{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@_NSRange","text":"NSRange","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"range"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"withCoordinates:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"const"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@CLLocationCoordinate2D","text":"CLLocationCoordinate2D","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"coords","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"count:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@NSUInteger","text":"NSUInteger","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"count","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"range","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The range of vertices to replace. The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"location"},{"type":"text","text":" field indicates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the first vertex you are replacing, with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"type":"text","text":" being the first vertex, "},{"code":"1","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"being the second vertex, and so on. The "},{"code":"length","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" field indicates the number"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of vertices to replace."}]}]},{"name":"coords","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The array of coordinates defining part of the shape. The data in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this array is copied to the shape’s "},{"code":"coordinates","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}]}]},{"name":"count","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The number of coordinates from the "},{"code":"coords","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" array to insert in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"place of the coordinates in "},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The sum of "},{"code":"range","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s length and this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"count must not exceed the number of items currently in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coordinates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"property."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the shape is currently visible on the map as an annotation, it is redrawn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"immediately. If the shape is part of an "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" object, you must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"explicitly set the "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/shape","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" property in order for any style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layers that use the source to be redrawn."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"count"},{"type":"text","text":" is greater than the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":" field of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"range"},{"type":"text","text":", some vertices will"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"effectively be inserted into the shape. On the other hand, if "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"count"},{"type":"text","text":" is less"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":" field of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"range"},{"type":"text","text":", some vertices will effectively be removed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"range"},{"type":"text","text":" extends beyond the shape’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"coordinates"},{"type":"text","text":" property, an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSRangeException"},{"type":"text","text":" is raised. If you want to append new vertices to the shape,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-appendCoordinates:count:"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint\/replacecoordinatesinrange:withcoordinates:count:"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint\/replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Replaces the vertices at the given range in the shape with the specified number"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of vertices from a given C array."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMultiPoint(im)replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:"}],"symbolKind":"method"},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPoint/replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:":{"abstract":[{"text":"Replaces the vertices at the given range in the shape with the specified number","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of vertices from a given C array.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint\/replacecoordinatesinrange:withcoordinates:count:","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint\/replaceCoordinatesInRange:withCoordinates:count:","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape":{"abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is an abstract class that represents a shape or annotation. Shapes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"constitute the content of a map — not only the overlays atop the map, but also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the content that forms the base map."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShape","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MLNShape","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource":{"abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies vector shapes to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shown on the map. The shapes may be instances of "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or they may be defined by local or external"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GeoJSON"},{"type":"text","text":" code. A shape source is added to an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object along with an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object. The vector style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layer defines the appearance of any content supplied by the shape source. You"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can update a shape source by setting its "},{"code":"shape","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"URL","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSource","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MLNShapeSource","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The proxy object for the current map style."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MLNStyle","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPoint":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipoint","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint","type":"reference"},{"text":" class is an abstract superclass used to define shapes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"composed of multiple vertices.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"MLNMultiPoint","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MLNMultiPoint","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPoint","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource/shape":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The contents of the source. A shape can represent a GeoJSON geometry, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"feature, or a collection of features."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"shape"}],"title":"shape","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource\/shape","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/shape","kind":"symbol"}}}